Privacy policy URL: publish the policy in privacy-policy.md at a stable public HTTPS URL.
Review contact: supply real name, telephone, and email in App Store Connect.
Price, territories, and Kids category age band: owner decisions before submission.
Complete Apple's current age-rating questionnaire based on the final build; do not infer a rating from the intended audience.
Use screenshots captured from the actual release build, not promotional concept art.
